### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/triggers/slack/message_edited/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection_id": "{{slack_connection_id}}",
  "webhook_url": "https://webhook.site/your-unique-url-here",
  "config": { "channel_id": "{{slack_channel}}" },
  "extra_metadata": { "notes": "for the #support-eu channel" }
}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### 🔧 Subscribe — message_deleted, scoped to one channel (same config shape as new_message)
### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/triggers/slack/message_deleted/subscribe
