### 🔧 Subscribe — user_joined_channel, scoped to one channel
### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/triggers/slack/user_joined_channel/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection_id": "{{slack_connection_id}}",
  "webhook_url": "https://webhook.site/your-unique-url-here",
